cing Paper - for tattoo Stencil\n\n ₹700\n ₹1000\n\n View Details\n\n### No products found\n\nTry adjusting your filters or search query.',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-09-23 16:18:52','2026-09-23 16:47:38'),(2,'Avon Equipment Warranty & Return Policy','note','Official Policy Guidelines','All Avon tattoo machines (including Titan Wireless Pen and Force Digital Power Supply) include a 1-Year Official Studio Warranty. Returns & refunds are accepted within 14 days of delivery for unopened, sealed products in original packaging. Needles and inks are sterile medical supplies and cannot be returned once opened unless damaged in transit.',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-09-23 16:22:26','2026-09-23 16:22:26'),(3,'Cartridge Needle Compatibility & Safety Specs','note','Technical Equipment Guide','Avon Precision Pro cartridges feature a 100% silicone backflow safety membrane to prevent ink/fluid backflow into rotary motors. Compatible with all Cheyenne-style rotary pen machines and standard grips. Needle configurations: Bugpin #10 (0.30mm) for fine line micro-realism, Standard #12 (0.35mm) for bold lining & magnum shading.',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-09-23 16:22:26','2026-09-23 16:22:26'),(4,'Rotary Pen Machine Stroke & Voltage Recommendations','note','Masterclass Tech Notes','Operating voltage guidelines for Avon Titan Wireless Pen: 6.5V - 8.5V for soft black & grey shading and dotwork; 7.5V - 9.5V for solid lining (09RL to 18RL). Dual 2000mAh batteries provide 8-10 hours runtime each. Charge via standard 5V 2A USB-C charger. Avoid fast chargers exceeding 18W.',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-09-23 16:22:26','2026-09-23 16:22:26'),(5,'Avon Studio Express Shipping & Live Order Tracking','note','Fulfillment & Logistics','Orders are dispatched within 24 hours via Bluedart, Delhivery, or FedEx Express. Shipping duration is 2-4 business days across India. Track your order live using your Order ID (e.g., #1) or AWB Tracking Number (e.g., BD78912345IN) in our AI Chatbot or Track Order page.',NULL,NULL,1,'2026-09-23 16:22:26','2026